# Yantra Accident Alert System

## 📌 Overview

The Yantra Accident Alert System is an IoT-based accident detection and emergency alert system using an ESP32.

The system is designed to detect possible accidents using motion sensors, determine the accident location using GPS, and send an emergency notification through a communication network.

## 🎯 Objectives

- Detect possible vehicle accidents.
- Reduce false accident detections.
- Obtain the accident location.
- Send an emergency alert.
- Provide a reliable and low-cost accident detection system.

## 🛠️ Technologies

- ESP32
- PlatformIO
- Arduino Framework
- C/C++
- Git
- GitHub

## 🔧 Hardware

- ESP32
- Accelerometer/Gyroscope
- GPS module
- Communication module
- Emergency/cancel button

